1. { -KEY- } Ke7 $1 { Preparing zugzwang. } ( 1. Be4 $2 { would only draw after } Nd6 2. Ke7 Nc8 $1 ) 
Nd8 2. Be4 $1 { Preventing the check on c6, which means that Black is left with a single reply. } Nf7 3. Bf3 { Losing a tempo... } Nd8 4. Bd5 $1 { ...and there it is, the magic distance. White wins. } 
