 { Here is a similar example. Anybody acquainted with the magic distance idea will soon find the solution. } 1. { -KEY- } Nd4+ $1 { A typical deflection sacrifice. } Nxd4 2. Kf6 $1 { The magic distance, delaying the knight checks to a maximum. } Nc2 3. h5 Ne3 4. Kg5 $1 { Again the same theme. } Nc4 5. h6 ( { Black resigned, in view of } 5. h6 Ne5 6. h7 Nf7 7. Kf6 Nh8 8. Kg7 { - Eingorn. } ) 

